note bottom of FOLDER_BINDING
  The aggregates of the stream/topic/folder are stored in a unique binding
  same user/container area.
  The container counters don 't store the individual messages.
  Updates are impotent and eventually agreed upon;
  Restoration/reconstruction is done only in the background.
  The system bindings are fixed rule/type;
  Automatically FOLDER_ITEM It 's a background performance ..
  The source: active USER_STREAM_BINDING and STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats: All of them .; Personal: private = true; Channels: private = false.
end note

note bottom of REACTION_MATERIALIZER
  API Changes exactly one of the original fact lines.
  API Never performs a cycle. «reading  change  record» I 'm going to take pictures ..
  Facts  the source of truth; You can rearrange the images..
  Both pictures are written by one person. fenced owner scope=message.
  Topic lock For the canonical snapshot Not used.
end note

note bottom of PROJECTION_TASK
  Types of tasks: fanout; content_mentions; reaction_snapshot;
  read_counters; delivery_snapshot_event;
  topic_membership_policy_rebuild; topic_state_projection;
  folder_projection.
  Initial design: without coalescing.
  Unique outbox_event_uuid; retry derivation = no-op.
  Lease expiry + fencing; retry/backoff; max attempts/DLQ;
  reaper/reconciliation; idempotent handler.
  Routing: topic Only for placements/bindings;
  message For the snapshots; user-stream/user-topic/user-folder For the aggregates.
  Shared scope He doesn 't have fallback I 'm on topic.
  Atomic delta It requires exactly-once guard The outbox_event_uuid;
  Otherwise scope worker recomputes/writes.
end note

note bottom of STREAM_BINDING
  Persistent lifecycle row.
  Revoke: active=false + generation++ synchronously.
  Re-add: fresh generation; stale fanout/history no-op.
  Message/reaction read It requires active + generation equality.
end note

note bottom of SEND
  The author and his link USER_MESSAGE_STATE They 're created synchronously ..
  No fan distribution to the recipients.
  No recounting of the aggregates.
  Unchanged event in the outgoing event journal (outbox) It 's part of the transaction ..
  GET/The list operation doesn 't create tasks ..
  The author sees the message immediately.
end note

note bottom of STREAM
  If direct_user_uuid It 's set, private = true.
  direct_user_uuid, equal to UUID The current owner, It means chat with yourself.:
  One tie . owner, One visible participant.
  Vending to recipients does not add user-linking,
  So the canonical message is visible once..
end note

note bottom of WS_DISPATCHER
  The background player doesn 't have a network connection ..
  The controller sends, repeats and plays ready events.
end note

note bottom of TOPIC_CLAIM_A
  Different topics can be worked on in parallel.
  One of them (project_id, topic_uuid) Not more than one slot.
  Within each captured topic , new ones are selected first.:
  MESSAGE.created_at DESC.
  Example: 14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15.
  Time labels and bindings do not specify the order.
  Additional key/cursor for equal tags remains open.
  The receiver may be delayed by about a second ..
  It 's a planned consistency in the end ..
  The Order «New ones first .» Shouldn 't lead to starvation of old messages .;
  The limited justice is within the capture of the subject.
  The mechanism of capture/release/recapture remains open..
  There 's no hidden backup sectioning of the stream ..
end note

